  (no_connect (at 124.76 127.54) (uuid 4f3a127f-1a3b-49cd-94a1-5c58d173bf09))
  (no_connect (at 124.76 130.08) (uuid cc869b72-b4c7-4e1e-af8d-f152cd5b59f4))
  (no_connect (at 124.76 132.62) (uuid 26e59993-674b-4f58-9143-ba56cc70241b))
  (no_connect (at 456.03 110.16) (uuid e3051088-5222-4cbd-9139-6500e7b729b9))
  (no_connect (at 483.97 94.92) (uuid 7ba14e56-1bfe-436f-ace9-30a5cf006659))
  (no_connect (at 130.16 352.54) (uuid d86b124d-b5ed-4716-b4ae-653a0794f288))
  (text "1. ВХОД (5-22 V соларен панел) -> MPPT ЗАРЯДНО BQ25798 (PROG 1S, 750 kHz, 2.2 uH)" (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 74f95931-cc7f-416a-b029-4856c32911b0))
  (text "SS54: защита от обратна полярност и връщане към панела. D3 (SMBJ24A) пази VBUS до 25 V." (at 20 174 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 35dbf00a-1c5b-4832-ba52-32f9c2886f89))
  (text "PROG = 1S винаги (R1 4.7k): с 2S PROG BQ тръгва с VSYSMIN ~7 V. За LTO 2S MSPM0 записва VREG 5.6 V и чак тогава пуска CE." (at 20 177.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8220669a-17ba-4fd2-857f-6d474a4efce6))
  (text "~CE: R4 към 3V3M = без заряд, докато MSPM0 не го свали (PA11). TP2 (QON) към GND = излизане от ship режим." (at 20 181 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ed59d254-46c2-40c6-8d3a-9b3ad6bf3b01))
  (text "2. SYS -> 3V3M (HT7533, 2.5 uA) за MSPM0 + J6 OUT (SYS през идеален диод Q5 + Q9/Q11)" (at 225 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e98dbea1-0945-4c28-981e-56bf90d27157))
  (text "Q5 (AO3401A): D към SYS, S към J6, тялото му е диодът SYS -> OUT; Q9/Q11 го отварят, докато OUT < SYS (~30-50 mV пад, ~7 uA)." (at 225 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8cc8ec26-e79f-4449-96b8-8b8d74fa6d26))
  (text "Товар със свое зарядно не може да върне ток в батерията. HT7533 храни само MSPM0 (SYS до 5.6 V при LTO)." (at 225 143.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bd075cce-9485-4def-84ee-2fefaa979123))
  (text "3. БАТЕРИЯ 1S Li-ion / LiFePO4 или 2S LTO: Ship FET (Q2 + JP3) -> J4 (BATT+, BM, BATT-)" (at 20 186 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9f549b62-60c2-4be6-9feb-9768fd1aeb38))
  (text "Q2 (AO3400A): S към BAT, D към батерията; в ship режим спира разреждането (UVLO, SDRV). JP3 затворен = без ship FET." (at 20 252 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c5c338bd-0e69-4d8f-a3ab-c02086d7786d))
  (text "J4: 1S = BATT+ / BATT-, BM свободен. 2S LTO = BM е средната точка (балансиране)." (at 20 255.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 158bc404-058d-4d40-b3cb-4429a5bf2e37))
  (text "4. BMS: Q3 HJ8205 (OD разряд / OC заряд) + шунт 20 mOhm + балансиране 2S" (at 330 186 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c2c38538-b5fa-4e48-bf4f-7a3c18171549))
  (text "Q3 е в минуса: S1 = BATT- (клетката), S2 = BATT_S -> RS1 -> GND. OD (G1) вкл. по подразбиране (R18), OC (G2) вкл. щом има 3V3M (R20), MSPM0 го изключва." (at 330 272 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1b7f06c8-4bdd-4490-8c47-1ba28ca7e8ac))
  (text "Без DW01A: ток/късо пази MSPM0 (OPA0 PGA + COMP0 с DAC, 32 ns) и BATFET OCP на BQ25798." (at 330 275.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6121c0f2-3e97-4306-b96d-cc0650895e74))
  (text "Шунт: + заряд, - разряд; R21-R24 изместват входовете с ~33 mV. Балансиране ~40 mA (100 Ohm, 0.18 W)." (at 330 279 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 02c1ea73-c642-45e1-95bd-82fd485d52f2))
  (text "5. MSPM0L1306: BQ25798 master (I2C1), INA260 емулатор 0x41 (I2C0 -> J5), BMS, LED" (at 370 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid da23e4ae-de63-44a5-96cd-30436f53c5de))
  (text "J5 pin 3 (3V3E) е захранването на репийтъра: тук не се ползва, pull-up резисторите са на репийтъра." (at 370 176 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b35b8625-d4e9-467d-ad77-ea301736c91f))
  (text "SWD: TP12 3V3M, TP13 GND, TP11 SWDIO, TP16 SWCLK в ред (стъпка 2.54), TP17 NRST отделно. J5 = I2C0 на PA10/PA11 (само 3.3 V шина), ~CE PA17, OC_G PA0 (open-drain), LED PA9, J7 EN PA4, BAL1 PA2, BAL2 PA3, OD PA26, CHEM PA23, VBAT PA24/A3, VBM PA21/A5. PA1 и PA22 (изход на OPA0) не се свързват." (at 370 179.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c01baabe-548a-4b8b-9327-da85264445ea))
  (text "6. J7 U: TPS63070 buck-boost 3.3 V / 5.0 V (JP6), вкл. с JP5: - изкл. / 1-2 винаги / 2-3 от MSPM0" (at 20 300 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ddbaf718-2d90-47b5-82bf-a8a4d0a1f500))
  (text "FB: R33/R34 = 3.3 V; VSEL високо свързва R35 паралелно на R34 = 5.0 V. EN, VSEL, PS/SYNC към VIN само през R30 10k (TI 11.1)." (at 20 402 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d9fa87f0-a00a-404e-b12b-039921350400))
  (text "L2 2.2 uH (като L1) + 10 uF + 3x22 uF (TI табл. 3, Cout,eff >= 10 x L,eff). PS/SYNC високо = PFM при малък товар (~50 uA)." (at 20 405.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4c8352a6-f39e-4b88-9eee-ba9eb8461dd8))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
